---
import { whatsappUrl } from "../data/site";
---

<section id="contato" class="relative overflow-hidden px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_10%,rgba(232,199,115,.16),transparent_35%)]"></div>
  <div class="section-reveal mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-lg border border-gold-300/20 bg-white/[.04] px-6 py-12 text-center shadow-card sm:px-10 lg:py-16">
    <p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-gold-300">Vamos conversar?</p>
    <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-none text-white sm:text-6xl">Vamos conversar?</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-white/70 sm:text-lg">
      Cada cenário exige uma estratégia diferente. O primeiro passo é entender seus objetivos para identificar as melhores oportunidades.
    </p>
    <a href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-300 px-7 py-4 text-sm font-bold text-black shadow-gold transition hover:bg-gold-100 sm:w-auto">
      Solicitar análise no WhatsApp
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
